static PolicyOnly and BeforeDeny, cache refresh/absolute expiry/transaction authority, no premature observations of discarded attempts, no N+1 host structural/eligibility reads on 1k/10k CRM. Queryable definitions use fresh whereKey chunks and tenantOf; generic resolves once per unique ref. Eligibility must retain actual role/contribution field witness; external uses allowsMany. State map uses codec composite keys code/panel/build and storage/storageId/panel; unconfirmed attempts do not claim StateToken. Validate recursion same-key rejection permits legitimate different-permission chaining. Pay attention to changed scalar code, batching fast paths, owner/structural query protection and cross-group revisions.\n\nEvidence: accepted-checks.json and V*.log are actual scoped checks; batch-final.log includes final24 cases and newly added cross-group saturation. V1 original101tests25961assertions includes CRM1k/10k plus batch; V6 768related regressions135619assertions; three engines3tests1562assertions each; Arch72/314. V8 PHPStan0 (known optional turbo warning), V9 fresh serial core type99.64%, all209 eligible files reported (three unchanged vendor-plugin-excluded traits). API generator/check and changed PHP Pint/diff GREEN. Behavior checks preceded only type-array-shape/retry-empty guard edits in BatchEvaluation (no normal behavior change); final24 batch cases rerun after those edits. Read evidence independently; GREEN test summaries are not a substitute for code review. Avoid re-reviewing executor discussion or prior native reviews: this snapshot contains only code, contract, diff and checks."}],"_meta":{"screenMode":"headless","promptId":"62d52d98-d9ba-4e1f-8d9c-31f818101287"}}
